state-data.lst:6:5  Pose.Idle has no reach, but other options of Pose do. Every option needs every value, so give it one: Idle { reach = … }
state-data.lst:7:5  Pose.Run has no speed, but other options of Pose do. Every option needs every value, so give it one: Run { speed = … }
state-data.lst:8:5  Pose.Battle has no reach, but other options of Pose do. Every option needs every value, so give it one: Battle { reach = … }
